## 5. What the researcher might do next

The diff does NOT prescribe actions, but it lists workflow handles the researcher commonly reaches for:

- **Consensus RED-FLAG on novelty** → Workflow E' (sub-topic sweep) to catch up on the colliding work
- **Consensus RED-FLAG on consistency** → Workflow B (proposal-update major) — recent work has drifted from the proposal
- **Consensus CONCERN on coherence** → /first-principles (pause and rethink the contested decision)
- **One-sided novelty RED-FLAG** → check the URL evidence; if real, run a focused Workflow E intake; if hallucinated, log the dismissal
- **All dimensions OK or N/A** → no action; review served as a checkpoint, log entry will record the clean bill

The researcher is the decider. This list exists only so the next move has a clear name.
